{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ethereum/ERCs/pulls/1810","id":3847416437,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJvfjJM7lUup1","html_url":"https://github.com/ethereum/ERCs/pull/1810","diff_url":"https://github.com/ethereum/ERCs/pull/1810.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/ethereum/ERCs/pull/1810.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ethereum/ERCs/issues/1810","number":1810,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add ERC: WYRIWE — Input Provenance for AI Inference","user":{"login":"TMerlini","id":114340671,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtCzPw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114340671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TMerlini","html_url":"https://github.com/TMerlini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TMerlini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TMerlini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TMerlini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TMerlini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TMerlini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TMerlini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TMerlini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TMerlini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TMerlini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nWYRIWE defines a triple-hash commitment scheme and EIP-712 attestation profile that proves the input a model received matches the input the user intended.\n\n### The gap this fills\n\nERC-8126 (AI Agent Verification, Final) establishes agent-level trust but explicitly leaves the execution receipt layer out of scope. ERC-8004 attests agent identity — but no standard commits to the *input* before inference runs.\n\nWithout a committed input record, a settlement contract cannot verify the output corresponds to the funded input, and a dispute mechanism has no ground truth for what the model was actually asked to do.\n\n### What it specifies\n\n1. **Triple-hash construction** — `raw_input_hash → sanitization_pipeline_hash → input_hash` — forms an auditable, reproducible chain of custody verifiable by any third party without trusting the agent or gateway.\n2. **IDENTITY_SENTINEL_CID** — explicit, verifiable no-sanitization case (pinned at `QmccvoM6aRVgZ2dtFWvT6Wm3DmTvoAUHHotK7uQufnStVR`).\n3. **WyriweAttestation** — EIP-712 typed struct (8 fields, all required, field ordering normative).\n4. **EIP-712 domain** — `ERC8004AttestationGateway`, dynamic `chainId`.\n5. **Verification procedure** — 5 deterministic steps.\n6. **Gateway query interface** — `GET /agent/verify/:inputHash`.\n\n### Live implementation\n\nReference gateway: `https://gateway.ensub.org/agent/verify/:inputHash`  \nSource: https://github.com/Echo-Merlini/ccip-router  \nMainnet WyriweProofVerifier: `0xd8a09d830b27697e1b24e8c9800e562d20318a09`  \nLive interop tx: `0xc32b66ae9446e0d5282a6fc813ba106126a8da05bced638b83840d9c2510e4d0` (mainnet block 25289963)\n\n### Note on ERC number\n\n`eip: 11796` is a plausible placeholder based on the current highest PR in the queue. We defer the actual number to the editors and will rename the file on request.\n\n### Discussion thread\n\nhttps://ethereum-magicians.org/t/wyriwe-what-you-read-is-what-you-execute-input-provenance-for-verifiable-ai-inference/28655","created_at":"2026-06-11T13:06:46Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T14:38:33Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"7028fded4659d2b3bd1cf427806b9cffa81c403a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"eip-review-bot","id":128646734,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6r-Tg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128646734?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eip-review-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/eip-review-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eip-review-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eip-review-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eip-review-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eip-review-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eip-review-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eip-review-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eip-review-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eip-review-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eip-review-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":6129127607,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJvfjJM8AAAABbVMQtw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ethereum/ERCs/labels/t-erc","name":"t-erc","color":"FEF2C0","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6129463609,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJvfjJM8AAAABbVgxOQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ethereum/ERCs/labels/s-draft","name":"s-draft","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6130026993,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJvfjJM8AAAABbWDJ8Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ethereum/ERCs/labels/c-new","name":"c-new","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6138285773,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJvfjJM8AAAABbd7OzQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ethereum/ERCs/labels/e-consensus","name":"e-consensus","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6138322754,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJvfjJM8AAAABbd9fQg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ethereum/ERCs/labels/e-review","name":"e-review","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ethereum/ERCs/pulls/1810/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ethereum/ERCs/pulls/1810/comments","review_comm